apes, Backgrounds & Textures to create an original logo in no time. Logo designing app also provides professional photo editing and text editing tools. Now you can change Font, Flip, Rotate, Resize, Color, Hue and lots more that you'll need to create beautiful original logos.\r\n\r\nCreate festival poster design and make creative advertisement for your business. Now you can easily Design stunning social media posts, graphic design for social media and gaming, create motivational quotes, and more. Simple and easiest flyer maker you ever used. Easily design Templates, Document Temple, and become a Template Designer for Small Business Work Offline. With template designing, now you can Design document templates, image template useful to business or personal work to get final document, statement as image.\r\n\r\nKey Features of Logo Editor App:\r\nLogo from different categories like fashion, business, logo design, lifestyle, watercolor logo, and gaming logo\r\nCustomized logo with text\r\nBackground changer\r\nStickers and Template maker\r\nLogo Maker and Creator\r\nText art with multiple layers\r\nResize logos and text on logo as well\r\nCrop and rotate gaming logos\r\nPoster maker and template Maker\r\nLogo Esport Maker\r\nCreate gaming logo maker pro\r\nThousands of backgrounds and overlays\r\nUndo/Redo\r\nEdit and resize logos\r\nUse it offline\r\nDirectly save to gallery\r\nEasily share to social media\r\n\r\nThis Logo design app has thousands of logo ideas and designs for you that can help you in making a free business logo. Choose from and customize a wide range of custom logos for your business. This app provides drag and drop editor functionality that makes it easy to edit logos that suit your brand. Also you can create your own logos and templates with our huge library of shapes, stickers, graphics, fonts and colors.\r\n\r\nSo download this Logo maker app and show your creativity by using the amazing features and functionalities of this logo designing app.",
